  "template": "<div lang=\"es\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/coleccion/polimero-mundial/sri-lanka-200-rupias-1998/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"Central Bank of Sri Lanka — 200 Rupias (1998)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/coleccion/polimero-mundial/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Catálogo de Billetes de Polímero Mundial</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Billetes de Polímero Mundial &middot; Sri Lanka &middot; 1998</span>\n        <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">Central Bank of Sri Lanka</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Doscientas Rupias &middot; 50.&ordm; Aniversario de la Independencia (1948&ndash;1998)</p>\n      </div>\n<div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n<button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"sri-lanka-200-rupees-1998-polimero-negro\"\n            aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete, variante de serie negra\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/sri-lanka-cbsl-200-rupees-1998-polimero-negro.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/sri-lanka-cbsl-200-rupees-1998-polimero-negro.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Billete conmemorativo de 200 rupias de polímero del Central Bank of Sri Lanka, variante de número de serie negro, anverso arriba con el Salón Conmemorativo de la Independencia, reverso abajo con un panel histórico\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"563\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>\n              Ampliar\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n</div>\n\n      <!-- ============ SHARED DETAILS INTRO ============ -->\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n        <section>\n          <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Contexto Histórico y de Emisión</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Un billete conmemorativo del medio siglo:</strong> el Central Bank of Sri Lanka emitió este billete de 200 rupias en 1998 para conmemorar el 50.&ordm; aniversario de la independencia del país (1948&ndash;1998).</p>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Impreso en Australia:</strong> Note Printing Australia (NPA), con sede en Melbourne, imprimió el billete sobre sustrato de polímero Guardian&reg;, con ventana transparente en forma de flor de loto y registro perfecto entre ambas caras.</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n          <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave Visibles en el Billete</h2>\n          <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Anverso:</strong> el Salón Conmemorativo de la Independencia en la Plaza de la Independencia de Colombo, junto a viñetas del progreso del país en los 50 años previos &mdash;la unidad nacional, la educación y salud gratuitas, el Proyecto de Desarrollo Mahaweli, el Aeropuerto Internacional Bandaranaike y el Puerto de Colombo.</span>\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> un extenso panel histórico con escenas de Sri Lanka &mdash;la llegada del Príncipe Vijaya, la introducción del budismo por el Arahat Mahinda, la unificación de la isla por el rey Dutugemunu, la construcción de la fortaleza rocosa de Sigiriya, el embalse Sea of Parakrama, la colonización europea y a Wariyapola Sri Sumangala Thero arriando la bandera británica en 1815.</span>\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Ventana transparente:</strong> ventana estilizada en forma de flor de loto en la esquina superior derecha del anverso.</span>\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Imagen de sombra translúcida:</strong> representación artística del león heráldico de Sri Lanka portando una espada, integrada en el cuerpo del polímero y visible al trasluz.</span>\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Registro perfecto:</strong> roseta simétrica de flor de loto en el lado derecho del anverso, que encaja perfectamente con el patrón de impresión del reverso.</span>\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Fluorescencia UV:</strong> la matriz de números de serie exhibe una respuesta luminiscente distintiva bajo luz ultravioleta.</span>\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colorido:</strong> tonos azules, grises y morados en el subimpreso multicolor.</span>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </section>\n\n        <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; margin-top:36px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">País</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Sri Lanka</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Entidad Emisora</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Central Bank of Sri Lanka</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denominación</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Doscientas Rupias (Rs. 200) &mdash; billete conmemorativo</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Polímero &mdash; sustrato Guardian&reg;</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Impresor</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Note Printing Australia (NPA), Melbourne, Australia<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Año de Emisión</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">1998, por el 50.&ordm; aniversario de la independencia (1948&ndash;1998)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2</sup></span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Firmas</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Chandrika Bandaranaike Kumaratunga (Ministra de Finanzas) &middot; A.S. Jayawardena (Gobernador del Banco Central)</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensiones</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">146 &times; 74 mm</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- ============ VARIANT: BLACK SERIAL ============ -->\n      <section style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 32px;\">\n          <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,30px); line-height:1.1; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 10px;\">Variante &mdash; Número de Serie Negro</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Pick-114b</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n          \n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:64px auto; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.16);\"></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ VARIANT: RED SERIAL ============ -->\n      <section style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 32px;\">\n          <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,30px); line-height:1.1; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 10px;\">Variante &mdash; Número de Serie Rojo</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Pick-114a</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"sri-lanka-200-rupees-1998-polimero-rojo\"\n            aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete, variante de serie roja\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/sri-lanka-cbsl-200-rupees-1998-polimero-rojo.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/sri-lanka-cbsl-200-rupees-1998-polimero-rojo.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Billete conmemorativo de 200 rupias de polímero del Central Bank of Sri Lanka, variante de número de serie rojo, anverso arriba con el Salón Conmemorativo de la Independencia, reverso abajo con un panel histórico\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"564\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>\n              Ampliar\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:44px auto 0; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notas</h2>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">1. Numista y fichas de catalogación coinciden en atribuir la impresión a Note Printing Australia (NPA), Melbourne, sobre sustrato de polímero Guardian&reg;.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">2. Central Bank of Sri Lanka, ficha de emisión del billete conmemorativo de Rs. 200 de 1998: emitido por el 50.&ordm; aniversario de la independencia de Sri Lanka (1948&ndash;1998).</p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n    <div\n      role=\"dialog\"\n      aria-modal=\"true\"\n      aria-label=\"Billete ampliado\"\n     \n     data-zoom-dialog=\"note-1\" hidden class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n      <button\n        data-zoom-close\n        aria-label=\"Cerrar\"\n        style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n      >&times;</button>\n\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n        <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out\n          disabled=\"true\"\n          aria-label=\"Alejar\"\n          style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n        >&minus;</button>\n        <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n        <button\n          disabled=\"false\"\n          data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Acercar\"\n          style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n        >&#43;</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div\n        style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; touch-action:none;\"\n      >\n        <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n          <img data-zoom-image\n            src=\"\"\n            alt=\"Billete del Central Bank of Sri Lanka, vista ampliada\"\n            draggable=\"false\"\n            style=\"display:block; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; object-fit:contain; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n      </div>\n\n      <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Arrastra para mover &middot; Rueda del ratón para ampliar</span>\n    </div>\n  \n\n  \n\n</div>",
