      "ogTitle": "Central Bank of Sri Lanka — 200 Rupias de Polymer (1998)",
      "ogDescription": "Banknote conmemorativo de 200 rupias de Sri Lanka, por el 50.º aniversario de independencia, variantes de número de serie rojo y negro.",
      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/world-polymer/sri-lanka-200-rupees-1998/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"Central Bank of Sri Lanka — 200 Rupias (1998)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/world-polymer/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; World polymer banknote catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">World Polymer Banknotes &middot; Sri Lanka &middot; 1998</span>\n        <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">Central Bank of Sri Lanka</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Two Hundred Rupees &middot; 50.&ordm; Independence Anniversary (1948&ndash;1998)</p>\n      </div>\n<div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n<button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"sri-lanka-200-rupees-1998-polimero-negro\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote, variante de serie negra\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/sri-lanka-cbsl-200-rupees-1998-polimero-negro.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/sri-lanka-cbsl-200-rupees-1998-polimero-negro.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Commemorative polymer 200-rupee banknote of the Central Bank of Sri Lanka, black serial-number variety, obverse above with Independence Memorial Hall, reverse below with a historical panel\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"563\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n</div>\n\n      <!-- ============ SHARED DETAILS INTRO ============ -->\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n        <section>\n          <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Historical and Issue Context</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">A half-century commemorative banknote:</strong>The Central Bank of Sri Lanka issued this 200-rupee banknote in 1998 to commemorate the 50.&ordm; anniversary of the country’s independence (1948&ndash;1998).</p>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Printed in Australia:</strong>Melbourne-based Note Printing Australia (NPA) printed the note on Guardian&reg; polymer substrate, with a transparent lotus-shaped window and perfect registration between both sides.</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n          <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Key Details Visible on the Banknote</h2>\n          <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Obverse:</strong>the Independence Memorial Hall in Colombo's Independence Square, along with vignettes of the country's progress in the previous 50 years &mdash;national unity, free education and health, the Mahaweli Development Project, the Bandaranaike International Airport and the Port of Colombo.</span>\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>an extensive historical panel with scenes from Sri Lanka &mdash;the arrival of Prince Vijaya, the introduction of Buddhism by Arahat Mahinda, the unification of the island by King Dutugemunu, the construction of the Sigiriya rock fortress, the Sea of Parakrama reservoir, European colonization, and Wariyapola Sri Sumangala Thero lowering the British flag in 1815.</span>\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Transparent window:</strong>stylized lotus-flower-shaped window in the upper-right corner of the obverse.</span>\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Translucent shadow image:</strong>artistic depiction of Sri Lanka's heraldic lion carrying a sword, embedded in the polymer and visible when held to the light.</span>\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Perfect registration:</strong>symmetrical lotus-flower rosette on the right side of the obverse that aligns perfectly with the reverse printing pattern.</span>\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">UV fluorescence:</strong>The serial number array exhibits a distinctive luminescent response under ultraviolet light.</span>\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Color:</strong>blue, gray and purple tones in the multicolor subprint.</span>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </section>\n\n        <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; margin-top:36px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Sri Lanka</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Issuing Entity</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Central Bank of Sri Lanka</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Two Hundred Rupees (Rs. 200) &mdash; Commemorative Banknote</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Polymer &mdash; substrate Guardian&reg;</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Printer</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Note Printing Australia (NPA), Melbourne, Australia<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Year of Issue</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">1998, for the 50.&ordm; anniversary of independence (1948&ndash;1998)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2</sup></span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Signatures</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Chandrika Bandaranaike Kumaratunga (Finance Minister) &middot; A.S. Jayawardena (Central Bank Governor)</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensions</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">146 &times; 74 mm</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- ============ VARIANT: BLACK SERIAL ============ -->\n      <section style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 32px;\">\n          <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,30px); line-height:1.1; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 10px;\">Variety &mdash; Black Serial Number</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Pick-114b</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n          \n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:64px auto; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.16);\"></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ VARIANT: RED SERIAL ============ -->\n      <section style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 32px;\">\n          <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,30px); line-height:1.1; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 10px;\">Variety &mdash; Red Serial Number</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Pick-114a</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"sri-lanka-200-rupees-1998-polimero-rojo\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote, variante de serie roja\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/sri-lanka-cbsl-200-rupees-1998-polimero-rojo.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/sri-lanka-cbsl-200-rupees-1998-polimero-rojo.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Commemorative polymer 200-rupee banknote of the Central Bank of Sri Lanka, red serial-number variety, obverse above with Independence Memorial Hall, reverse below with a historical panel\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"564\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:44px auto 0; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notes</h2>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">1. Numista and cataloguing sheets agree in attributing the printing to Note Printing Australia (NPA), Melbourne, on Guardian&reg; polymer substrate.</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">2. Central Bank of Sri Lanka, issue record for the 1998 Rs. 200 commemorative banknote: issued for the 50.&ordm; anniversary of Sri Lankan independence (1948&ndash;1998).</p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n    <div\n      role=\"dialog\"\n      aria-modal=\"true\"\n      aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n     \n     data-zoom-dialog=\"note-1\" hidden class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n      <button\n        data-zoom-close\n        aria-label=\"Close\"\n        style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n      >&times;</button>\n\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n        <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out\n          disabled=\"true\"\n          aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n          style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n        >&minus;</button>\n        <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n        <button\n          disabled=\"false\"\n          data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n          style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n        >&#43;</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div\n        style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; touch-action:none;\"\n      >\n        <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n          <img data-zoom-image\n            src=\"\"\n            alt=\"Banknote ofl Central Bank of Sri Lanka, enlarged view\"\n            draggable=\"false\"\n            style=\"display:block; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; object-fit:contain; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n      </div>\n\n      <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n    </div>\n  \n\n  \n\n</div>",
